img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%94%E6%AF%9B%E6%89%8B%E8%A2%8B\" title=\"兔毛手袋\"><img alt=\"兔毛手袋\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-304701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-304701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%85%94%E6%AF%9B%E6%89%8B%E8%A2%8B\" title=\"兔毛手袋\">兔毛手袋</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>构成理念</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：304703</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3047/304703/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3047/304703/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3047/304703/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3047/304703/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3047/304703/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3047/304703/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3047/304703/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3047/304703/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">那个研究员总是让人头痛。<br />它不讲礼貌，肆无忌惮地咬坏实验室的桌椅，在安静的室内大吵大闹。在各位同事的力荐之下，这名研究员成功地当选了“年度科研之星”，作为奖赏，它将拥有一间隔音良好的独立办公室。这下，噪音问题得到了彻底的解决。<br />在场的所有人都非常满意，包括研究员本人。它难得安静地坐了下来，开始了新一轮的药剂实验，这吸引了它所有的注意力。<br />恰巧，有一名画家经过此处，他感慨于研究员的认真，于是把这一幕作为写生素材画了下来，并为此幅画作取名为《一名恬静的研究员》。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304703\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/97/Belonging-304704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“写真的工具”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Tools of the Trade\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />85<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者极少离身的物品套组，包括眼镜、特制乳胶手套与部分研究用具。灵感总是随时随地出现，如同宇宙运作般永不停歇。因此，保证手头永远有趁手工具十分重要。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/72/Belonging-304705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">荣誉的象征<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Symbols of Honor</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>科学院颁发的勋章与纪念钢笔，以表彰受访者在生物研究方面的杰出成就。显然，受访者对它们并不算在意。不过，它十分满意钢笔书写的流畅性，以及金质勋章的咬啮口感。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/42/Belonging-304706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">菱格袜子<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Argyle Socks</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>随处可见的毛线袜，优点为不易磨损、价格低廉。为了在正式场合“维持所谓的、最低限度的、该死的仪态”，受访者选择了附有袜带的款式。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%851.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 宇宙写真者1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%851.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%851.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%851.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%851.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%851.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%851.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%852.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 宇宙写真者2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%852.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%852.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%852.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%852.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%852.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%852.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">宇宙写真者 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Cosmos Photographer </small></span></span>"}}